::AfterSupplyChainCh11
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene 
@once

// Incoming call from Blaze

{@Blaze}   Locke! Have you heard? People all over the sector are disconnecting their Frontier software!
{@Player}   How are they getting the bots to work without it?
{@Blaze}   Well, Keela’s giving her original software away to everyone. Free. Open.
{@Player}  Arken said he was doing this on Blair too!
{@Blaze}   Yeah, we've been in touch. 
{@Player}     It’s got to feel good to rip out those cheap parts and give the bots some real upgrades!
{@Blaze}      We'll have fewer units, sure. But at least they'll be safe!
{@Player}   And the company owners on Kalvis are okay with this?
{@Blaze}       Well, we're not giving them much choice!
{@Blaze}       Now that they aren't under Frontier's thumb, they have no excuse not to negotiate.


